inal travel, humanity has colonized the galaxy, encountering multiple sentient species and founding thousands of new worlds living in a decentralized society marked by trade, diplomacy, and wars.\nDuring their expansion, humanity encountered a planet without intelligent life but with ancient temples that did not belong to any known advanced civilization. Anomalies in time behavior at these temples defy existing physical laws. The temples' enigma attracts various characters from across the galaxy - some seek to unlock ancient prophecies, others are driven by scientific or personal motives.\nThe struggle to control these temples escalates on a planet near the galactic core. WHO WILL BECOME THE MASTER OF STARVAULT?", "summary": "Choose your hero. Squad up. Push lanes. Farm creeps. Clear jungle camps. Upgrade your abilities mid-match. And dominate the map in intense 5v5 team fights.\nClassic MOBA with stunning visuals that push the Meta Quest to its absolute limits.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/starvault", "videos": [{"id": 156092, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "Zq5vuDVi67k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zq5vuDVi67k", "title": "STARVAULT | Open Beta Launch Trailer | Meta Quest", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zq5vuDVi67k/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}